  "description": "Connects the OASIS to SEEDS -- a regenerative economy platform and payment network built on EOSIO, designed to reward regenerative human behaviour with tokens. Stores OASIS holons and avatar data on SEEDS and integrates with its token economy. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
